  "StockRole": "Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "Now this is some Scientist logic, Commander. Take a Fafnir, replace its Heavy Gauss Rifles with lighter experimental ones whose capacitor banks can explode, bolt prototype Nano-Fluid Dampers onto them that can also explode, then wrap the whole mess in Ferro-Lamellor and CASE II so hopefully none of it actually does. Throw in an integrated Supercharger, Nova CEWS, and one of those torso-mounted DNI cockpits, and somehow they've turned an already terrifying assault 'Mech into something even more ridiculous. Just do me a favor, Boss—if the armor over those Gauss rifles starts disappearing, point this thing away from the rest of the lance.",
